// zl.util.Queue - FIFO queue API (native storage primitive).
//
// This file exists so `import zl.util.Queue` resolves to a real file, same
// as any user-defined package - the module loader doesn't special-case
// stdlib packages at the resolver level. The actual Queue.* functions are
// natives implemented in native.cpp; this class body is intentionally
// empty since native calls (Namespace.method(...)) are resolved by
// qualified-name lookup against the native table, not by looking at any
// class's declared members.
class Queue {
    // FIFO reference package: native storage is intentionally hidden behind this API.
    // API: newQueue, enqueue, dequeue, peek, isEmpty, size.
}
